          "text": "SHORT-FORM BRIEF \u2014 edit before running.\nFormat: slow-motion destruction\nTopic: language learning\nHook (first 1.5s): [one line]\nPayoff: [one line]\nOn-screen text: [exact copy or leave blank]\nRuntime: 12s, 9:16, sound-on by default."
